{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/36d9105929777e4ab016d55e3d7f34ab.avif?t=1754163438\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Ride UP isn\u2019t just a climbing game \u2014 it\u2019s a journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road is tough, winding, and full of falls. But with every restart, you get a little closer. Maybe to the top, maybe to yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This path unfolds inside the mind of Fred, the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His memories, regrets, and past take shape as maps you must ride through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet town streets to frozen peaks, from war-torn battlefields to mysterious realms, traverse 6 distinct chapters \u2014 all while hearing Fred\u2019s inner voice narrate the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/54fe3450eb2094bd1ede9ebfbe7596aa.poster.avif?t=1754163438\" width=628 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/54fe3450eb2094bd1ede9ebfbe7596aa.webm?t=1754163438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/54fe3450eb2094bd1ede9ebfbe7596aa.mp4?t=1754163438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based motorcycle climbing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 unique maps, 6 emotional states</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapters connected by strange portals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A narrative told through Fred\u2019s voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability and ranking system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3\u20134 hours of mental and physical challenge</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/2e6b2a1b4260c913e544ca41007a45a9.poster.avif?t=1754163438\" width=628 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/2e6b2a1b4260c913e544ca41007a45a9.webm?t=1754163438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/2e6b2a1b4260c913e544ca41007a45a9.mp4?t=1754163438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, both failure and success are in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may get angry, you may laugh \u2014 but somehow, you\u2019ll try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because some journeys aren\u2019t about reaching the end,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re about discovering who you are along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.poster.avif?t=1754163438\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.webm?t=1754163438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752520/extras/bc6481516ac7765a3700a37f596586da.mp4?t=1754163438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>